  <text x="471" y="164" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" fill="#16213e">自重訓練</text>
  <text x="471" y="182" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" fill="#16213e">雪橇（恢復期）</text>
  <text x="471" y="200" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" fill="#16213e">大力士變化性</text>
